<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- Hardened runtime, no entitlements. The app is not sandboxed (it reads
     the CLI's login in ~/.config/wayglass, which a sandboxed app could not
     see without a container of its own), so networking needs no entitlement,
     and a Go binary needs neither JIT nor unsigned executable memory.
     scripts/desktop-release.sh passes this file so a future entitlement is
     one line here, not a change to the script. -->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict/>
</plist>
